 \\mathfrak{B} \\Leftrightarrow \\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(\\mathfrak{A} \\models \\varphi \\Leftrightarrow \\mathfrak{B} \\models \\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B} \\Leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{A}) = \\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak{B})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\cong \\mathfrak{B} \\Rightarrow \\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B} \\Leftrightarrow \\forall n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;(\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv_n \\mathfrak{B})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\equiv \\mathfrak{B} \\Leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}^{\\mathcal{U}} \\cong \\mathfrak{B}^{\\mathcal{U}}","display":false}],"bytes":1752,"backlinks":[{"id":"983eb8fcfa54aec4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系签名条件，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\mathrm{PartIso}$、原单向 $\\mathrm{BackAndForth}$、$\\equiv$ 见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[57-df-back-and-forth]]、[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]。$\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[57-df-finite]]；$\\mathcal I$ 是按剩余步数分层的部分同构族，$p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}$。"},{"id":"80bd19d81f860e01","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"949f2378ce3c89ba","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d4e38b5fc56856c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bbf3699dee0bf4ca","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[